			"notes": "# Periodic Mod Fabric 1.17+1.17.1 Version 0.4.0\n### This is a feature update to periodic. It also comes with 1.17.1 support\n## Changelog:\nAdded Patreon links 😄 \nAdded support for 1.17.1 too (almost guaranteed)\nAdded Reinforced Diamond Tools and Armour\nAdded Reinforced Netherite Tools and Armour\nRefactored the armour and tool code structure\nChanged the mod title\nFixed a bug that was so small you probably didn't notice (75ad2c20eeba72bc28c418e24b50f11323587362)\n### You should not download the `-sources` version unless you are a developer here to hack around with the code"
