			"notes": "## Periodic Mod Fabric 1.17 Version 0.3.0\n### This is the 1.17 Update of Periodic to Minecraft 1.17, It comes with new features too (:D)\n## Changelog:\n* Updated the mod to 1.17\n* Mod now requires Java 16\n* Fix a critical bug with advancements\n* Refactored some code to make it easier to work with\n* Refactored Ore generation to use the API and not Mixins\n* Altered how Aluminium Ore drops to keep parity with how certain vanilla ores drop\n* #### Items\n> * Added `Raw Aluminium`\n> * Added Mercury (Mercury Buckets and the like)\n> * Added Gold Amalgam\n> * Added Sulfur\n> * Added Matches\n### You should not download the `-sources` version unless you are a developer here to hack around with the code"
		},
